    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, my left calf has been really swollen and tender for like two days now. it's kind of painful to touch. it's probably nothing but just wanted to check. i've also been feeling kinda short of breath today and my chest feels tight... i'm super stressed with work lately, do u think this is just anxiety kicking in?",
