    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait really? that sounds super scary. i mean it's been like this for a bit and it hasn't gotten worse yet... are u sure it's not just stress? i've been having these panic attacks lately and they feel way different. could it just be my nerves? i dont really wanna go to the hospital if i dont have to, it's so expensive",
